---
config:
  sequence:
    mirrorActors: false
    width: 120
    actorMargin: 40
---
%% A small sequence diagram. composition.svg shows it with the dark theme through the link release.mmd#theme=dark.
sequenceDiagram
    actor Dev as Developer
    participant CI as Build server
    participant Feed as Package feed
    Dev->>CI: Push tag v1.2
    Note over CI: Build and test
    alt tests pass
        CI->>Feed: Publish
    else tests fail
        CI-->>Dev: Report failure
    end
